flowchart TD
    A[Recruiter sources candidate] --> B[Upload resume / paste LinkedIn URL]
    B --> C[Auto-parsed, default Visible to Para AI]
    C --> D[Recruiter logs or syncs a call]
    D --> E[Transcribed + summarized, default Private]
    E --> F{Recruiter shares call with Para AI?}
    F -- Yes --> G[Item marked Visible to Para AI]
    F -- No --> H[Item stays Private]
    G --> I[Recruiter adds freeform note]
    H --> I
    I --> J[Recruiter submits candidate to 2+ opportunities]
    J --> K[Command Center shows parallel tracks per opportunity]
    K --> L[Para AI synthesizes shared context]
    K --> J1[Para AI surfaces a match the recruiter didn't choose]
    J1 --> J2{Recruiter confirms the match?}
    J2 -- Yes --> K
    J2 -- No / dismiss --> J3[Discarded, never becomes a track]
    L --> M{Action relationship-sensitive or high-stakes?}
    M -- No, logistics --> N[Auto-executed: e.g. scheduling email]
    M -- Yes --> O[Drafted action lands in Action Queue]
    N --> P[Logged to candidate activity timeline]
    O --> Q{Recruiter reviews queue item}
    Q -- Approve --> R[Action sent, opportunity stage advances]
    Q -- Edit --> R
    Q -- Reject --> S[Action dropped, not sent]
    R --> T[Command Center reflects updated stage]
    P --> T
    T --> U{Same-company double submission attempted?}
    U -- Yes --> V[Blocked, conflict banner shown, manual resolution required]
    U -- No --> W[Track proceeds normally]
    T --> X{Queue item unactioned past timeout?}
    X -- Yes --> Y[Escalation reminder shown, never auto-sent]
    X -- No --> W
    W --> Z{Opportunity outcome}
    Z -- Offer / Hired --> AA[Track closed: Hired]
    Z -- No longer pursued --> AB[Track closed: manually]
    Z -- Candidate withdraws entirely --> AC[All tracks close, all queued actions cancelled]
